# =============================================================================
# NETLIFY FRONTEND — the only environment variables the Next.js app itself
# reads. All three are public/browser-safe (NEXT_PUBLIC_*) and must be set in
# Netlify's site environment settings. Nothing else is required by the
# frontend: production email scheduling/delivery runs entirely through
# Supabase Cron -> Supabase Edge Function -> Resend, independent of Netlify.
# =============================================================================
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# =============================================================================
# SUPABASE EDGE FUNCTION SECRETS — NOT Netlify environment variables.
# These are configured separately via `supabase secrets set` (or the
# Supabase Dashboard) against the process-email-outbox Edge Function, and
# are never read by the Next.js app. Listed here only for documentation —
# do not add these to Netlify's environment.
#
#   RESEND_API_KEY        - Resend API key used only by the Edge Function.
#   EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS     - "Name <verified-sender@your-domain>" once a
#                            Resend domain is verified.
#   CRON_SECRET            - Shared secret the Edge Function checks against
#                            the x-cron-secret header pg_cron sends. Stored
#                            in Supabase Vault (name:
#                            email_processor_cron_secret), never here.
#   APP_BASE_URL           - The canonical deployed Preshopps URL, used by
#                            the Edge Function to build links in emails.
#                            Same conceptual value as NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL
#                            above, but a separate secret in a separate
#                            system -- keep both in sync manually.
#   EMAIL_TEST_RECIPIENT_OVERRIDE (optional) - non-production only; when
#                            set, every outgoing email is redirected to
#                            this address instead of the real recipient.
#
# SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are NOT listed above because
# the Supabase platform auto-injects both into every Edge Function's
# runtime automatically -- nothing to configure manually for either.
# =============================================================================
